      "description": "PRODUCT DESCRIPTION\nDiameter: 28cm\n\nCan be used with all types of stoves\n\nGas stove\n\nElectric stove\n\nInduction cooker\n\nFire stove\n\n- - - 5-layer structure - conducts and retains heat well, has a 3-layer structure, the outer shell is for magnetic capture, suitable for all types of induction cookers including stoves and pans; middle layer Thick is aluminum to conduct and retain heat, the inner layer in contact with healthy foods.\n\n- - Super non-stick and long lasting The non-stick layer is protected by high pillars, so it is not affected by cleaning and cooking utensils, so it is extremely durable and resistant. Good adhesion.\n\n- - Convenient insulated handle\n\n- - The handle is made of hollow casting, special technique paired with the pan wall, so it is not hot, smooth and shiny, so it is easy to clean and always beautiful and luxurious.\n\n- - Comfortable with cooking utensils\n\nEspecially with the surface that does not use coating but is fully non-stick laser engraving, it is absolutely safe and super durable, can use metal tools to cook without fear of peeling. Non-stick surface peeling.\n\nVisit the store >\n\nThe round bottom pan should be very suitable for stir-frying, cooking dishes in restaurants or family kitchens serving 3-6 servings.",
